---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="About">
  <h1>About Atrinik</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    Atrinik is developed in public as a collection of independently released
    components.
  </p>
  <h2>Clean-room renewal</h2>
  <p>
    Fresh MIT-licensed engine code is implemented independently. Classic
    software remains GPL licensed, and maps, graphics, sound, and other authored
    data retain their individual terms and attribution.
  </p>
  <p>
    <a href="https://github.com/atrinik/atrinik/issues/168"
      >Read the replacement roadmap on GitHub</a
    >.
  </p>
</Base>
